### 6.4 Dashboard Profit formula (reference)

```text
profit  = margin + income - expense
margin  = sales total + discounts + special discounts - item cost (qty * itemcost)
income  = credit payments received + petty cash CASH IN
expense = petty cash CASH OUT + credit/unpaid balance (tendertotal) + salary paid + discounts + special discounts
```

Discounts cancel out. Restock purchases are summed in the query but unused. Items with missing `itemcost` inflate profit.

